    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i've hit a wall and it's just not a wall i can climb over. i used to have so much to say with my music but now it's just... hollow. i can feel the talent draining out of me and i know i'll never reach those heights again. it's actually painful to even pick up my instrument because it just reminds me of who i used to be vs who i am now. i feel like a fraud just existing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
