    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "experimenting with different stuff isn't gonna work though. it's not just a slump. i can feel it in my bones that the well is dry. everything i write now feels like a cheap imitation of my old self. it's embarrassing. i'd honestly rather just stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a total joke who can't even play the songs they used to be famous for.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
